Wait — one more check on the SERVER_ERROR ordering after this change: error frame arrives (after pong would have... no pong is sent until the error frame arrives) ✓. Then ping → pong → resolve. `logged` filter runs after both connects. ✓

Also — `logLines` are file-global and shared across both engines in test 2; `logged` filters error/ws — only the failed engine logs an error ✓ (unimplemented logs nothing).

